<Legal title="Cookie Policy" updated="July 24, 2026">
  <p>
    NaN (operated by <strong>Helmcode S.L.</strong>) keeps cookies to the strict minimum: only the ones
    needed for the site to work. We don't use analytics, advertising or cross-site tracking, ever.
  </p>

  <h2>What cookies are</h2>
  <p>Small text files a website stores on your device to enable basic functionality.</p>

  <h2>Strictly necessary</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — security and content delivery. Sets <code>__cf_bm</code> and <code>cf_clearance</code>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>No tracking</h2>
  <p>
    We don't load analytics, advertising or fingerprinting scripts, and we don't build a profile of you.
    There is nothing to opt out of because there is nothing tracking you in the first place.
  </p>

  <h2>Other services</h2>
  <p>
    Google Fonts requests data to serve fonts but does not set cookies. Discord and our payment processor
    operate under their own policies once you leave for those services.
  </p>

  <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
  <p>
    You can manage or delete cookies anytime through your browser settings. Since we only set strictly
    necessary cookies, blocking them may affect how the site works.
  </p>
</Legal>
